    </div>

    <p class="cp-lead">What the protocol above calls for, and where the author obtained it in the USA. The product specifications are the part that matters &mdash; a Lawson 217 shoot bag is a size, not only a brand &mdash; and they have not changed. <strong>The suppliers date from the original document</strong>, so treat the addresses and telephone numbers as a starting point rather than as current.</p>

