            <td>Waxed cardboard (Freezur Board&#41; boxes, 12&frac12; &times; 23&frac12; &times; 5&frac12; in. For storing ears.</td>
            <td>Lawrence Paper Co., Lawrence, KS 66044 &middot; Associated Bag Company, Milwaukee, WI 53207</td>
          </tr>
